%%HP: T(3)A(D)F(.);
\<<
  IFERR CLEAR
"Enter coefficients of
the polynomial"
{ "    {}
" { 1 6 }
} INPUT OBJ\-> LIST\->
\->ARRY DUP 1 GET /
ARRY\-> LIST\-> DROP 1
- DUP 2 + ROLL DROP
{ NEG quad cubic
quar } SWAP GET
EVAL DEPTH 'D' STO
1 D
    START DUP TYPE
      IF 0 \=/
      THEN C\->R DUP
ABS
        IF .01 <
        THEN DROP
        ELSE R\->C .1
* \->Q .1 / EXPAN
COLCT
        END
      END D ROLL
    NEXT 2 FIX
  THEN BAD
  END
\>>
